│   E  同期ワーカーが 429 の後に Retry-After を無視する: honor the     │
│      header in every retry path, including the nightly               │
│      reconciliation job and the manual resync command                │
│                                                                      │
│   T  Team      Platform (PLT)                                        │
│   S  Status    Todo                                                  │
│   P  Priority  Medium                                                │
│   L  Labels    Bug, Area/reliability, Docs                           │
│   J  Project   None                                                  │
│                                                                      │
│   The sync worker doubles its delay after every 429 and never reads  │
│   Retry-After, so it retries sooner than the shop API allows and     │
│   gets limited again. 再試行が早すぎるため、制限が解除されません。   │
│                                                                      │
│   • Read Retry-After (seconds or an HTTP date) from the 429 response │
│   • Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay      │
│     • 上限は MAX_DELAY のまま                                        │
│   [x] Reproduce it against the stub                                  │
│   [ ] Cap the wait at MAX_DELAY                                      │
│   [ ] Cover the nightly reconciliation job                           │
